Package: ivcrtest
Type: Package
Title: Correlation-Restriction Test for Instrument Validity
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ratbek", "Dzhumashev", email= "ratbek.dzhumashev@monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Ainura", "Tursunalieva", email = "ainura.tursunalieva@csiro.au", role = "aut"))
Description: Tests whether the orthogonality restriction on an instrument remains
    compatible with the data once the sign and magnitude of endogeneity are
    restricted. Inference uses the modified conditional union-bound interval of
    Bei (2024), computed through the exact two-dimensional linear
    reparameterisation of the finite-grid map, with Imbens-Manski/Stoye and
    naive selected-endpoint intervals reported as diagnostics.
URL: https://github.com/Ainura-tur/ivcrtest
BugReports: https://github.com/Ainura-tur/ivcrtest/issues
